      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Reports of simultaneous carpal avascular necrosis in more than 1 bone are rare. This is a report of simultaneous Kienböck's disease and Preiser's disease in a 50-year-old woman with a remote history of steroid use but without a history of trauma or systemic illness."},
